KurumiFRP includes portions of frp v0.72.0 from https://github.com/fatedier/frp,
authored by the frp contributors. The source files retain their original notices.
KurumiFRP modifies them for embedding, lifecycle management, instance-scoped
logging and traffic statistics.

The Linux nftables rule layout is adapted from FRP Manager's panel/firewall.go,
https://github.com/Gogowwww/frp-manager. KurumiFRP modifies the rule generation
and lifecycle to use an explicit port set, a per-profile table and manual
application.

